{:adr-id "2607152600"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-0112 (growing of rice) rice-paddy-operations-coordination actor"
 :status :accepted
 :date "2026-07-15"
 :deciders ["Jun Kawasaki (agent-executed, standing authorization)"]
 :related ["ADR-2607122200" "ADR-2607011000" "ADR-2607152500"]

 :context
 "cloud-itonami-isic-0112 did not exist prior to this ADR (gh api
  repos/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0112 returned 404 before scaffold) --
  a fresh scaffold, not a repair of a prior stray artifact. Built from
  cloud-itonami-isic-0111 (growing of cereals, except rice) as the
  module-structure template, adapted to paddy-rice specifics (water-level
  logging/validation, flooding/drainage water-management scheduling,
  blast-fungus crop-health concerns, irrigation-equipment hard block),
  with clojure -M:test independently re-run before and after every push."

 :scope-exclusions
 ["direct field/irrigation-equipment operation (flooding/drainage valves, pumps -- farmer's exclusive authority)"
  "finalizing a pesticide-application decision (agronomist/farmer authority)"
  "agronomic decision authority -- what/when/how much to plant, spray, flood, drain, harvest (remains human authority)"]

 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-0112 with Governor, Facts, Registry, Store, Advisor,
  Phase, Operation, Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-0111 module-for-module,
  riceops.* namespace in place of cerealops.*):
  - Governor (PaddyOperationsGovernor): 6 hard checks (field-not-registered,
    no-execution, equipment-or-pesticide-decision-blocked [now covers
    :operate-field-equipment, :operate-irrigation-equipment, and
    :finalize-pesticide-application], op-not-allowed, field-record-invalid,
    water-level-invalid [NEW, paddy-specific]) + 3 escalation gates
    (always-escalate crop-health concern, cost-threshold supply orders,
    low confidence < 0.7)
  - Facts: supply categories with cost thresholds (seed/fertilizer/equipment
    including irrigation pumps), rice varieties (japonica/indica/glutinous/
    aromatic/upland -- excludes non-rice cereals), water-management-operations
    reference set (flooding/drainage/midseason-drainage/harvest-drain)
  - Registry: independent pure predicates (cost-exceeds-threshold?,
    acreage-non-positive?, water-level-negative? [NEW], confidence-below-floor?)
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (registered-field lookup, paddy field)
  - Advisor: Advisor protocol + MockAdvisor (4 ops, log-field-record now
    also carries :water-level)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate
  - Operation: composes advisor -> governor -> phase-gate (langgraph-clj wiring
    deferred, matching 0111's own stub)
  - Sim: demo runner with a working -main
  - Operations: log-field-record, schedule-field-operation,
    flag-crop-health-concern, order-supplies (closed allowlist, :effect :propose)
  - Tests: 35 tests / 107 assertions (facts, governor, phase, registry, store), all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - README/business-model/operator-guide describe the real API"

 :consequences
 {:positive
  ["Rice-growing (0112) now genuinely implemented and fully tested"
   "Scope boundaries (field/irrigation-equipment operation, pesticide-application decisions)
    hardcoded in governor checks, not just asserted in prose"
   "Crop-health escalation (flag-crop-health-concern, covers blast-fungus, always human) is
    a core design invariant"
   "Paddy water-level is a first-class, independently validated field (mirrors 0111's acreage
    validation), reflecting flooding/drainage water-management as rice growing's operational core"
   "Portable .cljc, zero JVM-only constructs, clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings"]
  :negative
  ["Real persistent store (Datomic/kotoba-server) is a follow-up (in-memory for now)"
   "langgraph-clj StateGraph wiring (real interrupt-before/checkpoint resume) is
    deferred scaffolding, matching 0111's own stub status"]}

